+### Unreleased input-validation changes
+
+The working tree adds a recoverable `try_x25519_shared_key` API and rejects
+non-contributory X25519 peers. Verification returns false on malformed
+inputs rather than panicking; PBKDF2 iterations and `scrypt_opt` log_n must
+be positive. These changes are not in the published 0.14.0 crate. See
+[CHANGELOG.md](./CHANGELOG.md) and [MIGRATION.md](./MIGRATION.md).
